<p>{{ $crmSettings['company_name'] }} is an internal tool for managing customers, sales and customer care. By signing in and using the system, users agree to the terms below.</p>
<h3>1. Accounts</h3>
<p>Accounts are issued by an administrator to each employee. Users keep their own password secret, do not share their account with others, and are responsible for every action performed with it.</p>
<h3>2. Acceptable use</h3>
<p>Use the system for work purposes only. Each person may only access data within the permissions granted to them. The system keeps an activity log for oversight.</p>
<h3>3. Customer data</h3>
<p>Customer information is a company asset. Do not copy, export or share data outside the company without permission.</p>
<h3>4. Changes to these terms</h3>
<p>The company may update these terms. New content takes effect once it is published on this page.</p>
